<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπομνησ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>awakening the recollection, suggestive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>M.</u>
				8.202
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν συμβαινόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					11.6
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τό,</span>
			<i>reminder,</i> Lemma to <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.291
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κὸν χορηγίας</span>
			<i>memorandum</i> of stage properties, Pap. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eos</u>
				32.30
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v/vi A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGen.</u>
				79.1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				32.33
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1343
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.149
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.289
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.106
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>provocative</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπομιμνήσκω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2b
				</span></i>
			), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πάθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.Med.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.88
			</span></i>.</div>
